" data-sizes=\"auto\"></div>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-date grve-h5 grve-heading-color\">\t\t\t<time datetime=\"2025-11-09T21:58:52+08:00\">\n\t\t\t\t11/09/2025\t\t\t</time>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-content\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"grve-post-title grve-heading-color grve-h3\" itemprop=\"headline\"><span>Photoshop Harmonize 协调功能是什么？有什么用</span></h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Adobe 在最新版本的 Photoshop 中正式引入了全新的 AI「协调（Harmonize）」功能，并进一步强化了与 Lightroom 的协同工作体验。这项功能可自动分析前景与背景的色彩与光线，使插入的对象自然融入画面，显著提升合成…</p>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<a class=\"grve-read-more grve-link-text\" href=\"https://www.shephe.com/post/photoshop-harmonize-feature-guide/\"><span>查看全文</span>\t\t\t\t<svg width=\"40px\" height=\"16px\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 16\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<polygon class=\"grve-arrow-line\" points=\"0 7 38 7 38 9 0 9\"></polygon>\n\t\t\t\t\t<polygon class=\"grve-arrow-point\" points=\"31.3481912 0 40 8 31.3481912 16 30 14.5816219 37.1 8 30 1.41837809\"></polygon>\n\t\t\t\t</svg>\n\t\t\t</a>","link":"https://www.shephe.com/post/photoshop-harmonize-feature-guide/","retrieved":1762753644095},{"title":"Lightroom AI 移除功能不适用于所在地区？为什么","contents":"<a class=\"grve-item-url\" href=\"https://www.shephe.com/post/lightroom-ai-remove-region-error/\" rel=\"bookmark\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Lightroom AI 移除功能不适用于所在地区？为什么</span></a>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-media\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-media-inner grve-radius-none grve-shadow-none\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-background-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-bg-image lazyload\" data-bgset=\"https://www.shephe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Lightroom-blue.webp 1536w, https://www.shephe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Lightroom-blue-768x512.webp 768w\" data-sizes=\"auto\"></div>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-date grve-h5 grve-heading-color\">\t\t\t<time datetime=\"2025-11-08T22:18:35+08:00\">\n\t\t\t