挂着三篇“我们家被撞”的日志了，真是离了大谱！前几天那起被撞的事儿还没理清楚，肇事者影子都没找到，结果今天下班回家，又！又！又被撞了！这频率都快赶上周更了。 今儿重庆下大雨，白天工作倒是挺顺，我想着早点撤，不然晚高峰…</p>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<a class=\"grve-read-more grve-link-text\" href=\"https://www.shephe.com/life/%e5%86%8d%e6%ac%a1%e8%a2%ab%e6%92%9e/\"><span>查看全文</span>\t\t\t\t<svg width=\"40px\" height=\"16px\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 16\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<polygon class=\"grve-arrow-line\" points=\"0 7 38 7 38 9 0 9\"></polygon>\n\t\t\t\t\t<polygon class=\"grve-arrow-point\" points=\"31.3481912 0 40 8 31.3481912 16 30 14.5816219 37.1 8 30 1.41837809\"></polygon>\n\t\t\t\t</svg>\n\t\t\t</a>","link":"https://www.shephe.com/life/%e5%86%8d%e6%ac%a1%e8%a2%ab%e6%92%9e/","retrieved":1762321613177},{"title":"邪了门了！车车年审以后一周内发生了三次擦挂","contents":"<a class=\"grve-item-url\" href=\"https://www.shephe.com/life/%e9%82%aa%e9%97%a8/\" rel=\"bookmark\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">邪了门了！车车年审以后一周内发生了三次擦挂</span></a>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-media\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-media-inner grve-radius-none grve-shadow-none\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-background-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-bg-image lazyload\" data-bgset=\"https://www.shephe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/医院监控.webp 1600w, https://www.shephe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/医院监控-768x512.webp 768w\" data-sizes=\"auto\"></div>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-date grve-h5 grve-heading-color\">\t\t\t<time datetime=\"2025-10-29T18:12:41+08:00\">\n\t\t\t\t10/29/2025\t\t\t</time>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-content\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"grve-post-title grve-heading-color grve-h3\" itemprop=\"headline\"><span>邪了门了！车车年审以后一周内发生了三次擦挂</span></h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>车车六年，上周刚做了首次年审。以前没做过，倒也挺好奇。刚好刷抖音看到个团购，130 块不到就直接杀到现场。排队的人很多，客服还特地强调说我应该提前预约啥的，意思是我插队了，我也没理他。 排在我后面的是一辆老款宝马 3，发动机声音贼拉大，一听…</p>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<a class=\"grve-read-more grve-link-text\" href=\"https://www.shephe.com/life/%e9%82%aa%e9%97%a8/\"><span>查看全文</span>\t\t\t\t<